{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110614","id":2836507677,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6pEawd","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110614","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110614.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110614.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110614","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110614/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110614/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110614/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/09b8ac41bb73af724ad2b39953bf388a49aeef4b","number":110614,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Rephrase `Logger` documentation to be more explicit about thread-safety","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The current phrasing (as written by me) of the thread-safety warning for `Logger._log_message` and `Logger._log_error` is perhaps a bit too timid and arguably makes thread-safety sound optional, which it very much is not. Threads spun up by the engine internally can emit errors, which will invoke these callbacks from said threads, meaning any and all implementations of `Logger` are subject to race conditions unless accommodated for.\r\n\r\nI was/am a little bit tempted to throw in a scary \"or you can crash the entire process\" just to really drive home the point, but maybe that's excessive?","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https:/